02:00030628 6426            	  2009:     bcc  _L_z01_UpdateTrap_Full_Draw
                            	  2010:     ; Else reverse direction, and advace to state 2
                            	  2011:     ; with q-speed $20 (0.5 pixels a frame) (slow).
                            	  2012:     ;
