                            	  3043: Burrower_AnimateDrawAndCheckCollisions:
02:00039D10 4EB90004B9EA    	  3044:     jsr     Anim_AdvanceAnimCounterAndSetObjPosForSpriteDescriptor
                            	  3045:     ; If state = 0, return.
